# `sess.opts.cg.llvm_args` of a standalone trustc compile on trust-mc-driver's
# Trustc route, one element per line, for the driver's argv test session
# (project_compiler_route_tests.rs `argv_test_args`). Both sides test against
# this file: the driver must produce it, the engine must parse it.
# `@CARGO_PKG_VERSION@` stands for the version of the crate reading the file.
--trust-mc-engine-args=pct1:10
--check-version=@CARGO_PKG_VERSION@
--log-level=warn
--assertion-reach-checks
--harness
check_add
--c-lib
/opt/Application%20Support/stub.o
--default-unwind
3
--reachability=harnesses
